process realizeProject:
	(This the actual but highly simplified process of creating this project)
	2 computer are available
	
	(We will consider the people involved as ressources since they can't do 2 at the same time)
	1 Erwan is available
	1 Maxence is available
	
	work creatingProject
	work creatingFeatureMaxence uses 1 computer, 1 Maxence
	work creatingFeatureErwan uses 1 computer, 1 Erwan
	work pushing
	work pulling
	work fixingEclipse
	work mergingEverything uses 1 computer and 1 Erwan
	work bugfixing uses 1 computer and 1 Erwan
	work verifyEverything uses 1 Erwan, 1 Maxence and 2 computer
	work lastFixes uses 1 Erwan, 2 Maxence and 2 computer
	work presenting uses 1 computer, 1 Maxence and 1 Erwan (The step I may currently be doing at this point)
	
	(Step 1 : create the project)
	creatingProject finishes before creatingFeatureMaxence starts
	creatingProject finishes before creatingFeatureErwan starts
	
	(Step 2 : making features)
	creatingFeatureMaxence starts before pushing starts
	creatingFeatureErwan starts before pulling starts
	
	(Step 3 : use git to put everything in common)
	pushing starts before pulling starts (Maxence pushes then Erwan pulls)
	pulling finishes before fixingEclipse starts 
	pulling finishes before mergingEverything starts
	fixingEclipse finishes before mergingEverything finishes
	
	(Step 4 : finishing fixing and verify if everything is done according to the notation)
	lastFixes finishes before presenting starts
	verifyEverything finishes before presenting starts
	verifyEverything starts before lastFixes starts
	mergingEverything starts before lastFixes starts
	
	
	
	
	
	